# Collected raw source documents are NOT committed — they are large (GBs at scale)
# and the analysis agent only ever reads the extracted text + CSVs + manifest.
# We keep: docs/**/*.txt, data/*.csv, manifest.json, collection_notes.md,
#          docs/announcements/index.csv, collection_log.txt
# We drop: the raw downloads below (re-fetchable any time via the manifest URLs).
To-Analyze/**/*.pdf
To-Analyze/**/*.xlsx
To-Analyze/**/*.zip
To-Analyze/**/docs/**/*.html
